        <detaileddescription>
<para>&quot;This field MUST be present for this version of the IR. The axis this sharding &quot; &quot;corresponds to. Must be in the range of [-r, r - 1], where r is the rank of the tensor. &quot; &quot;Negative axis values means counting from the back.&quot; <linebreak/>
 </para>
